  "bodyHash": "n5gFDllKfPA=",
  "content": "<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-api\"><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/CottonMC/Vivatech/master/docs/fabric_badge.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"230\" height=\"77\" /></strong></a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>Fabric 服务端</strong>模组。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">允许您打开并操作在线及离线玩家的物品栏和末影箱。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">只需在服务器上安装！</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li>&nbsp;</li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">支持饰品栏（Trinkets）</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">支持 LuckPerms 权限</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; font-size: 24px;\"><strong>物品栏</strong></span></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/elpDEle.gif\" alt=\"操作物品栏动图\" width=\"524\" height=\"230\" /></span></p>\n<h2><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; font-size: 24px;\"><strong>末影箱</strong></span></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/dqVrUmX.gif\" alt=\"操作末影箱动图\" width=\"524\" height=\"210\" /></span></p>\n<h2><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; font-size: 24px;\"><strong>离线玩家</strong></span></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/dhQ7czc.gif\" alt=\"操作离线玩家动图\" width=\"524\" height=\"189\" /></span></p>\n<h3><strong><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">命令</span></strong></h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">/view (inv<strong>|</strong>echest) &lt;玩家名&gt;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">（需要 OP 权限）</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>权限节点</strong></span></h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">invview.command.root - 允许玩家使用 /view 命令</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">invview.command.inv - 允许玩家使用 /view inv 命令</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">invview.command.echest - 允许玩家使用 /view echest 命令</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">invview.command.trinket - 允许玩家使用 /view trinket 命令</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">invview.protected - 保护玩家的物品栏不被他人打开</span></p>\n<span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">invview.can_modify - 禁止玩家编辑正在查看的物品栏（默认为 true）</span>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
  "contentType": "text/markdown",
  "type": "modrinth"
}
